    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The project is a residential compound on a total area of 12,500 sqms, comprising 165 apartments and duplex units. The project is a joint venture between Tiraz and Mohammad bin Abdul Aziz&nbsp;Al-Rajhi &amp;&nbsp;Sons Co.</p>\r\n",
